        <mxCell id="arch_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Architecture note&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Start simple: Python + PostgreSQL + tool wrappers. Add Temporal for durable workflows, Neo4j for relationships, Redis for rate limiting, MinIO for evidence, and a CAPTCHA/Bot Challenge Guard between every browser/tool worker and active execution. Do not expose internal services publicly; access dashboards through SSH tunnel/VPN/reverse proxy with strong auth." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0B1220;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
