        <mxCell id="final" value="&lt;b&gt;Final design statement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;v7 is a recon operating system: tools discover, AI reasons, graph connects, validators reduce false positives, human validates impact. Only evidence-backed candidates become reports. Monitoring keeps the system fresh. Policy gate enforces safety at every action." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0B1220;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
