        <mxCell id="mod" value="&lt;b&gt;Tools / Modules (concrete CLI)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;# AI Active Discovery (back-fed to Stage 4):&lt;br&gt;#   - Framework endpoint predictor (Spring /actuator, Rails /rails/info)&lt;br&gt;#   - JS file hunter (lazy chunks, sourcemaps, service workers)&lt;br&gt;#   - Hidden route discovery (React/Vue/Angular Router config)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;# AI Reasoning (Stage 9):&lt;br&gt;#   - Code audit on recovered/ source · file:line candidates&lt;br&gt;#   - JS deep review · feature flags · debug · auth boundary candidates&lt;br&gt;#   - Auth flow logic review (OAuth/JWT impl reading)&lt;br&gt;#   - Workflow state machine audit&lt;br&gt;#   - Semantic endpoint classification (admin/debug/payment)&lt;br&gt;#   - Disclosed reports deep reading · variant hunting&lt;br&gt;#   - Cross-stage correlation (graph traversal)&lt;br&gt;#   - Safe payload/test-card generation (context-aware, non-destructive)&lt;br&gt;#   - Impact chain synthesis (hypothesis until validated)&lt;br&gt;#   - FP filter (read raw response · confirm/reject)&lt;br&gt;#   - Asset graph reasoning (cookie scope · trust pivots)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0B1220;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
