        <mxCell id="ob" value="&lt;b&gt;Objective&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Three compliant workflows powered by the identity/session layer: (A) allowed self-signup creates owned test accounts · (B) authenticated action injects owned sessions into browser context · (C) recovery flow testing analyzes password reset / magic link behavior. All three respect Stage -1 Policy Gate and CAPTCHA/Bot Challenge Guard." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0B1220;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
