        <mxCell id="obj" value="&lt;b&gt;Objective&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Allow AI to propose creative actions without letting it bypass the workflow. This page defines how AI outputs are queued, scored, gated, and routed into approved tool runs, manual validation, graph queries, report notes, or rejection." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#A78BFA;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
