        <mxCell id="audit" value="&lt;b&gt;Every proposal and execution decision should persist:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;proposal_id · program_id · run_id · policy_snapshot_id · asset_ids · source_evidence_refs · requested_action · risk_class · decision · reviewer_if_required · timestamp · tool_config_hash · stop_conditions · resulting_artifacts. This prevents AI actions from becoming invisible or impossible to review." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
